Description:
    Creates the migration for the gem's document storage (Y::Document +
    Y::DocumentUpdate). The models and Y::DocumentChannel ship in the gem,
    so the migration is the only file this adds to your app. If the app has
    config/importmap.rb, it also pins yrby-client, yjs, and @rails/actioncable
    to the JavaScript the gem ships.

Example:
    bin/rails generate yrby:install

    This will create:
        db/migrate/XXXXXXXX_create_y_tables.rb

    To also generate an application channel:
        bin/rails generate yrby:install --channel

    Implement authorized?(key) in the generated channel before using it.
